{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What is capital of France? \\\n           Respond with a JSON object in a ```json``` code block containing \"name\", \"population\", and \"founded\". \\\n           Use integer values for population and founded year (negative for BC). Do not include extra text. \\\n           Example: {\"name\":\"Paris\",\"population\":2139000,\"founded\":-250}"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024}